in_smoke_evidence:
  rule: "Detectability after firing the main battery from smoke is the hull's visibilityCoefGKInSmoke (plus visibilityFactorInSmoke, near zero), capped at the gun range. The client builds it without the ship's modifiers (CommonBattleLogicClasses/EntityVisibility.py EntityVisibilityBySmoke: constructed from params alone, and _calculateDistance ignores the modifier), unlike surface detectability, which multiplies visibilityDistCoeff. The port card shows the same hull value (ttx/FactoryVisibility.py). Concealment Expert and the concealment upgrades change only visibilityDistCoeff, so they do not change it."
  checked:
    - name: Concealment Expert
      surface: 6.83
      in_smoke_after_firing: 2.82
    - name: Concealment System Modification 1
      surface: 6.83
      in_smoke_after_firing: 2.82
